<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.27 pct, 3-mo 21.15 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.27 pct, 3-mo 21.15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady for the one-month maturity at 21.27 percent and edged up for the three-month maturity to 21.15 percent, up 0.01, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on its  BUBOR Reuters page on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
